A component-based web application using native **Web Components** — zero framework dependencies.

## Getting Started

```bash
npm install
npm run dev
```

Open http://localhost:3000 in your browser.

## Architecture

```
src/
├── components/      # Web Components (app-header, feature-card, etc.)
│   ├── app-header.js
│   ├── feature-card.js
│   ├── interactive-counter.js
│   └── app-footer.js
├── styles/
│   ├── main.css           # Global styles, CSS custom properties
│   └── components/        # Per-component stylesheets
└── main.js                # App entry point (smooth scrolling)
```

## Key Concepts

- **Shadow DOM** — Encapsulates styles and markup per component
- **Custom Elements** — HTML tags defined via JavaScript (`app-header`, `feature-card`)
- **CSS Custom Properties** — Global theming via `:root` variables
- **HTML Templates** — Component markup defined in `<template>` elements

